# else carries only what the drive builders make: the folders and top files below (make-usb.ps1 $StickFolders,
# $StickTextFiles and its stick root, this tool, linux/lib/usbc_live.py and the NOMAD drive files) and boot images at
# the top. Anything else at the drive's top is the owner's own and stays off, unless the owner names it with
# --keep-own-file. Privacy-safe default; files inside the builders' folders are not looked at by this rule.
